# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout OS.
# Windows contributors keep CRLF in their working tree (core.autocrlf=true is the
# Git for Windows default); this only controls what's stored in git and what CI
# (always Linux) sees. Prevents `forge fmt --check` / prettier / eslint from
# flagging line-ending-only diffs that differ by platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let git try to diff/merge binaries as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
